---
description: Review roles index. Use when running one role of the PR review process (bug hunter, verifier, security, risk classifier, convergence).
globs: reviewers/*.md
alwaysApply: false
---

Each role is a prompt in `reviewers/`: `bug-hunter.md`, `verifier.md`, `security.md`, `risk-classifier.md`, `risk-second-opinion.md`, `pre-pr-self-check.md`, `convergence.md`.

Run one role per fresh chat (or fresh background agent) with only the diff, the PR intent, `REVIEW.md` and `AGENTS.md`. Without parallel agents, run roles sequentially and start a new chat between roles.
